rs)\t15\nPayment method\tMonthly deduction from customer's salary\nMonthly Installment Amount ( )\t4,235.51\nPayment Type\tPrincipal and Profit\nEarly settlement amount\t1-2 Years: Total profit amount of the 1st two years After 2 years: profits of the three subsequent installments\n\n\n*The Annual Percentage Rate (APR) may differ based on the amount and maturity period.\n** Above example is according to product terms & conditions as of 1st Feb 2026, (rate 6.06% & Salary date 27th )\n\nMurabaha Deposit\nExample: 1\nInvestment amount ( )\t100,000\nInvestment Tenor (Months)\t1\nProfit margin %\t0.400\nNumber of withdrawals allowed\tNot applicable\n\n\nThe above table is for illustration only, and the profit margin may differ according to the amount and maturity period.\n\nExample: 2\nInvestment amount ( )\t1,400,000\nInvestment Tenor (Months)\t6\nProfit margin %\t1.00\nNumber of withdrawals allowed\tNot applicable\n\n\nThe above table is for illustration only, and the profit margin may differ according to the amount and maturity period.\n\nExample: 3\nInvestment amount ( )\t1,000,000\nInvestment Tenor (Months)\t12\nProfit margin %\t0.550\nNumber of withdrawals allowed\tNot applicable\n\n\nThe above table is for illustration only, and the profit margin may differ according to the amount and maturity period.\n\nCredit Card\nCard Type\tVisa Platinum\nCredit Limit\t10,000\nUsed Amount by customer\t10,000\nTawarruq\t2.49%\n\n\nAnnual Fee\n\n*All new cards issued after December 15th will have no annual fees.\n\n\t 399\nMinimum Payment Due\t5%\n(APR) Annual Percentage Rate\t45.41%\nPeriod to pay total outstanding\t60 months\n\n*All new cards issued after December 15th will have no annual fees.\n*APR May differ depending on Card Type\n\nSME\nProduct\tAnnual Percentage Rate*\tAdministration Fees\tMinimum (or) Maximum Administrative Fees\nShort Term Loans\t5% - 7% plus SIBOR\t1.5% - 3%\tN/A\nMid Term Loans\t6% - 8% plus SIBOR\t1.5% - 3%\tN/A\n\n\n*Above rates may change based on